    "_splunk_cluster_comment": "Splunk-native HA cluster (Phase 3) \u2014 replaces the single all-in-one splunk VM (splunk_vm_id above; disable-never-delete, kept as a distributed search peer during migration). Five full Splunk Enterprise VMs, native install driven by the ansible-splunk splunk.splunk role (docs/SPLUNK_CLUSTER_DESIGN.md there). Topology: a 2-peer indexer cluster (RF=2/SF=2, the supported minimum), two INDEPENDENT search heads (not an SHC \u2014 an SHC requires 3 members, one more than affordable here), and one lightweight management VM carrying cluster manager + license master + monitoring console + a third unclustered search head. Placement: one indexer + one search head per node across proxmox-1 and proxmox-4 (mgmt on proxmox-4); the remaining nodes are hands-off or unused. DHCP/DNS-first (dhcp:true, no host octet): each guest is reached by {name}.{domain}; the deterministic-MAC DHCP reservation + Technitium A-record own the address. Positional VMID decode (see docs/INFRASTRUCTURE_NUMBERING.md): 4211I0 = tier 4 (observability/security, VLAN 40 'siem') \u00b7 sub 2 (SIEM data plane, same plane as the cribl pipeline that feeds it) \u00b7 crit 1 (core) \u00b7 OS 1 (VM/qemu) \u00b7 instance I \u00b7 env 0. Ports (Splunk web 8000 / HEC 8088 / mgmt 8089 / S2S 9997 / replication 9887 / clustering 8080) are already opened cluster-internally by the splunk security group (modules/firewall/security_groups.tf) for any guest carrying the 'splunk' tag \u2014 no firewall change is needed. HARD DEPENDENCY: nodes.proxmox-4.commissioned is false above; commission and power on proxmox-4 before applying, or the three proxmox-4 guests cannot be created.",
    "splunk-idx-10": {
      "vm_id": 421100,
      "dhcp": true,
      "vlan": "siem",
      "name": "splunk-idx-10",
      "description": "Splunk indexer cluster peer on proxmox-1. Joins the cluster manager (splunk-mgmt-40) as a replication-factor peer; holds hot/warm/cold index buckets on its data disk. Native install via ansible-splunk (indexer group, configure_idxc_member).",
      "node_name": "proxmox-1",
      "cpu_cores": 6,
      "memory_dedicated": 12288,
      "tags": [
        "terraform",
        "splunk",
        "splunk-idx"
      ],
      "pool_id": "logging",
      "boot_disk": {
        "datastore_id": "local-zfs",
        "size": 64
      },
      "additional_disks": [
        {
          "interface": "scsi1",
          "datastore_id": "local-zfs",
          "size": 200
        }
      ],
      "clone_template": {
        "template_id": 9100
      },
      "user_account": {
        "username": "debian",
        "password": "",
        "keys": []
      }
    },
