    },
    "_grafana_comment": "AI/estate metrics visualization \u2014 Grafana OSS + VictoriaMetrics single-node as one Docker-in-LXC compose stack (ansible-proxmox-apps grafana_stack role). Observability tier 4 positional VMID (docs vmid-network-tiers). DNS-first (dhcp:true). VictoriaMetrics (:8428) receives Prometheus remote_write from the log/metric pipeline and stores long-retention series; Grafana (:3000) is Traefik-fronted and Authelia-gated. Dashboards and the datasource are provisioned by the role, so the UI state is disposable and rebuilds clean.",
    "grafana": {
      "vm_id": 410040,
      "node_name": "proxmox-1",
      "dhcp": true,
      "vlan": "mgmt",
      "hostname": "grafana",
      "summary": "Metrics dashboards",
      "description": "Grafana OSS + VictoriaMetrics single-node (Docker-in-LXC compose stack, grafana_stack role). VictoriaMetrics on 8428 receives remote_write and keeps long-retention series; Grafana on 3000 fronted by Traefik behind Authelia. Dashboards/datasource provisioned by the role.",
      "cpu_cores": 2,
      "memory_dedicated": 2048,
      "tags": [
        "terraform",
        "container",
        "grafana",
        "docker"
      ],
      "pool_id": "infrastructure",
